  NoteName: G. Sulli. 03
  NoteText: "13 - XX - 197X\n\n-The antenna seems to malfunction, and we're losing
    signal with the laboratory. Mary \r\nwent out to check the west antenna. I left
    her channel open, there's only static, and it \r\nsounds like laboured breathing.
    Viiktor ordered us not to go out after him.\r\n\r\n-That was hours ago"
